      "writtenOn": "2025-10-27T19:56:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In that case can you do:\n\n```\nio.attributes.interpolation \u003d core::Interpolation{core::InterpolationType::kFlat};\n```\n\nTo make it clear what the type is?",
